![Stardew Valley](cover.png)

A simple tool that enables you modify the community center items and
names. It's web based with PHP.

Is compatible with Stardew Valley 1.4 and also is a self contained
app now you can generate the XNB file needed to replace the one in
the game for your custom one.

If you need you can replace the YML files inside www/resources/yaml
with your custom ones to begin with an already modified community
center.

Just execute `ccmod.cmd` and you will be all set (Windows only tool,
but the xnb files can work in any OS).

> Note: Because the script generates a heavy webpage (50mb) it will
> took a little while to load successfully.

- <https://github.com/NinjasCL-archive/stardewvalley-ccmod>

## Technologies

- Laravel 5
- PHP
- Yaml
- jQuery
- Bulma.css
- Windows CMD

## Example Bundle

The game requires you to use animal products in the Community Center
for completing the arc. I wanted a vegan alternative so I made a
little mod just for that.

![Bundle](bundle.webp)

### Installation

Copy `Bundles.xnb` replacing the file in `Data/Bundles.xnb` inside
the StarDew Valley files.

### Important

- Backup your files.
- Use at your own risk.
- This is beta, may crash the game. Currently tested on SDV v1.1.

```github
NinjasCL-archive/stardewvalley-veganmod | Un mod que modifica el Centro Comunitario de Stardew Valley
```
